    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ri11](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ri11) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 63.159 depth occurred on Oct 18 2025 20km E of Cagwait. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 8.8617 longitude 126.4677. It impacted 189387 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
